ViridianCity_Text_CanCarryMonsAnywhere::
    .string "Ten years ago, the AURA changed\n"
    .string "every POKéMON's TYPE overnight.\p"
    .string "My dad still can't believe his\n"
    .string "GROWLITHE is part ICE now.$"

ViridianCity_Text_GymClosedWonderWhoLeaderIs::
    .string "This GYM has been closed ever since\n"
    .string "the LEADER left on a long trip.\p"
    .string "Rumor says HEPHA forges her own\n"
    .string "steel. I'd love to see it.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ViridiansGymLeaderReturned::
    .string "OPANIHRUM GYM's LEADER returned!$"

ViridianCity_Text_WantToKnowAboutCaterpillarMons::
    .string "You want to know about the two\n"
    .string "kinds of caterpillar POKéMON?$"

ViridianCity_Text_OhOkayThen::
    .string "Oh, okay then!$"

ViridianCity_Text_ExplainCaterpieWeedle::
    .string "They look alike, but since the\n"
    .string "AURA they are not the same.\p"
    .string "CATERPIE has a PSYCHIC side.\n"
    .string "WEEDLE has an ELECTRIC one.\p"
    .string "Mind WEEDLE's sting. It shocks!$"

ViridianCity_Text_GrandpaHasntHadCoffeeYet::
    .string "Oh, Grandpa!\n"
    .string "Don't be so mean!\p"
    .string "I'm so sorry. Since the TEAM ONYBRIS\n"
    .string "news, he doesn't trust strangers.$"

ViridianCity_Text_GoShoppingInPewterOccasionally::
    .string "I go shopping in PYROPIA\n"
    .string "occasionally.\p"
    .string "I have to take the winding trail in\n"
    .string "CINDER FOREST when I go.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ThisIsPrivateProperty::
    .string "I absolutely forbid you from\n"
    .string "going through here!\p"
    .string "This is private property!$"

ViridianCity_Text_OfferCatchDemo::
    .string "Well, now, I've had my coffee!\n"
    .string "Hm? You're working on a POKéDEX?\p"
    .string "Whenever you catch a POKéMON, the\n"
    .string "POKéDEX updates its data.\p"
    .string "Shall I show you how to catch\n"
    .string "one?$"

ViridianCity_Text_DemoAnytime::
    .string "Suit yourself.\n"
    .string "Come back whenever you like.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouHowToCatchMons::
    .string "Watch closely, then!$"

ViridianCity_Text_ThatWasEducationalTakeThis::
    .string "There! Now tell me, that was\n"
    .string "educational, was it not?\p"
    .string "And here, take this, too.$"

ViridianCity_Text_WatchThatToLearnBasics::
    .string "If there's something you don't\n"
    .string "understand, watch that.\p"
    .string "It will teach you about the basics\n"
    .string "of being a POKéMON TRAINER.$"

ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch::
    .string "Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\n"
    .string "that's what I need to get going!\p"
    .string "But I made it too strong.\n"
    .string "It gave me a headache…\p"
    .string "Incidentally, are you filling your\n"
    .string "POKéDEX?\p"
    .string "At first, focus on weakening the\n"
    .string "POKéMON before trying to catch it.$"

ViridianCity_Text_HowsTeachyTVHelping::
    .string "Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\n"
    .string "that's what I need to get going!\p"
    .string "But I made it too strong.\n"
    .string "It gave me a headache…\p"
    .string "Incidentally, is my old TEACHY TV\n"
    .string "helping you?$"

ViridianCity_Text_MyGrandsonOnTheShow::
    .string "Wahaha!\n"
    .string "It's my grandson on the show!\p"
    .string "Since he's the one doing the\n"
    .string "teaching, you're bound to learn.$"

ViridianCity_Text_TooBusyForTeachyTV::
    .string "Hm… You're too busy to not even\n"
    .string "have the time for TEACHY TV…\p"
    .string "Time is money, and neither should\n"
    .string "be ill spent…$"

ViridianCity_Text_CitySign::
    .string "OPANIHRUM \n"
    .string "City of the Black Opal$"

ViridianCity_Text_CatchMonsForEasierBattles::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "Catch POKéMON and expand your\n"
    .string "collection.\p"
    .string "The more you have, the easier it\n"
    .string "is to battle.$"

ViridianCity_Text_MovesLimitedByPP::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "The battle moves of POKéMON are\n"
    .string "limited by their POWER POINTS, PP.\p"
    .string "To replenish PP, rest your tired\n"
    .string "POKéMON at a POKéMON CENTER.$"

ViridianCity_Text_GymSign::
    .string "OPANIHRUM POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "THE FOUNDRY - LEADER: HEPHA$"

ViridianCity_Text_GymDoorsAreLocked::
    .string "OPANIHRUM GYM's doors are locked…$"


ViridianCity_Text_RefAsk::
    .string "BRUN: Hunters came last night, looking\n"
    .string "for rare POKéMON to sell. They\n"
    .string "want them back in cages.\pI cannot fight them alone.$"

ViridianCity_Text_RefHunter1::
    .string "HUNTER: Rare ones fetch a fortune!\n"
    .string "Stay out of this, child!$"

ViridianCity_Text_RefHunter2::
    .string "HUNTER: You beat my partner? Fine,\n"
    .string "I am not afraid of a ranger!$"

ViridianCity_Text_RefGives::
    .string "BRUN: You saved the day. The post\n"
    .string "has a gift for you: LARVITAR!$"

ViridianCity_Text_RefAfter::
    .string "BRUN: Take good care of it. The\n"
    .string "next REFUGE post is waiting.$"

ViridianCity_Text_RefEarly::
    .string "BRUN: Not yet. Finish the earlier\n"
    .string "posts first. The KEEPER at the\n"
    .string "SAFARI ZONE knows the order.$"

ViridianCity_Text_RefDone::
    .string "BRUN: Thank you again. The REFUGE\n"
    .string "is safer because of you.$"

ViridianCity_Text_RefIdle::
    .string "BRUN: I watch over the animals here.\n"
    .string "The world is quieter now.$"

ViridianCity_Text_TQ_Ask::
	.string "A NUGGET for my collection. Bring\n"
	.string "me one, will you?$"

ViridianCity_Text_TQ_Ok::
	.string "How it shines! Take this SCARF.$"

ViridianCity_Text_TQ_Done::
	.string "My shelf has never looked better.$"

ViridianCity_Text_TQ_NoRoom::
	.string "Your BAG is full. Make room, then\n"
	.string "come back.$"


